OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow Airport train services
OL,4,Aresume after trackside fire disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains to and from Heathrow Airport
OL,7,Fwere halted after a trackside grass
OL,8,Ffire caused delays and cancellations.
OL,10,FNational Rail said there was a "major
OL,11,Fdisruption" to services following the
OL,12,Fincident which began shortly after
OL,13,F16:00 BST.
OL,15,FA statement said all lines were blocked
OL,16,Fbetween London Paddington station and
OL,17,FHeathrow's terminals, as well as
OL,18,FReading, due to "a failure of the
OL,19,Felectricity supply caused by a fire
OL,20,Fnext to the track".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
